四分之一会再长。每天把水喝够的人，五年里复发的只有一成多，少了一半多。英国指南给的量是每天喝 2.5 到 3 升水…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/16-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["确诊痛风就长期吃降尿酸药，把血尿酸压到 360 µmol/L 以下并一直维持"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["痛风要长期吃降尿酸药，把尿酸压到 360 µmol/L 以下，不能只在疼的时候吃止痛药。由护士按化验结果帮着调药量的病人，两年后 95% 达标，照常看病的只有…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/16"},"children":["阅读整个主题：得了慢性病之后怎么活 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"广告 · 社区推荐"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"生财有术官方 Logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["广告 · 社区推荐"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["读过的知识，能不能做成有用的产品？"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["从电子书、资料到小工具，看看圈友怎样发现需求，把内容变成实际交付。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-actions"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-link","href":"/shengcaiyoushu?sc_group=reading&sc_creative=read_product&sc_placement=ad_footer"},"children":["看看社区与案例",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"18","height":"18","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"curr